<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. The values the FAQ 1 to FAQ 4 styles read, as --<p>-*
  variables for the section root's style attribute (p: faq1, faq5, faq6,
  faq7). live-faq.js derives the same list from the settings and writes the
  ones that change. Colours follow the colour scheme until "Enable custom
  styling" is on; fonts follow the theme until "Enable custom fonts" is on.
  card_bg_fb and card_border_fb: the section's own item background and
  border when no custom colour is set.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign st = section.settings
  assign own = st.enable_custom_style
  assign align = st.content_alignment | default: 'left'
  assign cta = 'center'
  if align == 'left'
    assign cta = 'flex-start'
  elsif align == 'right'
    assign cta = 'flex-end'
  endif
-%}
--{{ p }}-bg:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.section_bg, fallback: 'var(--color-background)' %}{% else %}var(--color-background){% endif %};--{{ p }}-pt:{{ st.padding_top | default: 60 }}px;--{{ p }}-pb:{{ st.padding_bottom | default: 60 }}px;
--{{ p }}-col-gap:{{ st.col_gap | default: 60 }}px;
--{{ p }}-align:{{ align }};--{{ p }}-mi:{% if align == 'center' %}auto{% else %}0{% endif %};--{{ p }}-cta-justify:{{ cta }};
--{{ p }}-gap-header:{{ st.gap_header_to_items | default: 32 }}px;--{{ p }}-maxw:{{ st.max_content_width | default: 800 }}px;
--{{ p }}-h-m:{{ st.heading_size_mobile | default: 26 }}px;--{{ p }}-h-d:{{ st.heading_size_desktop | default: 36 }}px;--{{ p }}-heading-color:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.heading_color, fallback: 'var(--color-heading)' %}{% else %}var(--color-heading){% endif %};
{%- if st.enable_custom_heading_weight -%}--{{ p }}-hw:{{ st.heading_weight | default: 600 }};{%- endif -%}
--{{ p }}-gap-sub:{{ st.gap_heading_to_subheading | default: 12 }}px;--{{ p }}-sub-m:{{ st.subheading_size_mobile | default: 14 }}px;--{{ p }}-sub-d:{{ st.subheading_size_desktop | default: 16 }}px;--{{ p }}-sub-color:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.subheading_color, fallback: 'var(--color-text)' %}{% else %}var(--color-text){% endif %};
--{{ p }}-gap-items:{{ st.gap_between_items | default: 0 }}px;
--{{ p }}-card-bg:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.card_bg, fallback: card_bg_fb %}{% else %}{{ card_bg_fb }}{% endif %};--{{ p }}-card-border:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.card_border_color, fallback: card_border_fb %}{% else %}{{ card_border_fb }}{% endif %};--{{ p }}-radius:{{ st.item_radius | default: 0 }}px;--{{ p }}-divider:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.divider_color, fallback: 'var(--color-border)' %}{% else %}var(--color-border){% endif %};
--{{ p }}-py:{{ st.item_padding_y | default: 20 }}px;--{{ p }}-px:{{ st.item_padding_x | default: 4 }}px;
--{{ p }}-q-color:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.question_color, fallback: 'var(--color-heading)' %}{% else %}var(--color-heading){% endif %};--{{ p }}-q-m:{{ st.question_size_mobile | default: 15 }}px;--{{ p }}-q-d:{{ st.question_size_desktop | default: 18 }}px;
{%- if st.enable_custom_question_weight -%}--{{ p }}-qw:{{ st.question_weight | default: 600 }};{%- endif -%}
--{{ p }}-hover:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.hover_color, fallback: 'var(--color-primary)' %}{% else %}var(--color-primary){% endif %};--{{ p }}-icon-color:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.icon_color, fallback: 'var(--color-heading)' %}{% else %}var(--color-heading){% endif %};
--{{ p }}-a-color:{% if own %}{% render 'scheme-color', color: st.answer_color, fallback: 'var(--color-text)' %}{% else %}var(--color-text){% endif %};--{{ p }}-a-m:{{ st.answer_size_mobile | default: 14 }}px;--{{ p }}-a-d:{{ st.answer_size_desktop | default: 15 }}px;
{%- if st.enable_custom_fonts and st.heading_font.family != blank -%}--{{ p }}-hf:{{ st.heading_font.family }}, {{ st.heading_font.fallback_families }};{%- endif -%}
{%- if st.enable_custom_fonts and st.body_font.family != blank -%}--{{ p }}-bf:{{ st.body_font.family }}, {{ st.body_font.fallback_families }};{%- endif -%}
{%- if st.image_ratio != blank -%}
  {%- case st.image_ratio -%}
    {%- when 'portrait' -%}{%- assign faq_ratio = '3/4' -%}
    {%- when 'landscape' -%}{%- assign faq_ratio = '4/3' -%}
    {%- when 'wide' -%}{%- assign faq_ratio = '16/9' -%}
    {%- else -%}{%- assign faq_ratio = '1/1' -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
--{{ p }}-gap-m:{{ st.gap_mobile | default: 30 }}px;--{{ p }}-gap-d:{{ st.gap_desktop | default: 60 }}px;--{{ p }}-ratio:{{ faq_ratio }};--{{ p }}-img-r:{{ st.image_radius | default: 16 }}px;
{%- endif -%}
</template>
